---
title: "calculateGeneration (stem-system members.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_status: check status
    q_check_status --> q_high_school: status == 1 (High School)
    q_high_school --> [*]: return 10 + (academicYear - 2025) - grade + 1
    q_check_status --> q_junior_high: status == 0 (Junior High)
    q_junior_high --> [*]: return 10 + (academicYear - 2025) + 4 - grade
    q_check_status --> q_other: status != 0 and status != 1
    q_other --> [*]: return null

    note right of q_check_status
        INV-001: Generation is derived from academic year, grade, and school level
        INV-002: Base generation is 10 (calibrated to year 2025)
        INV-003: Only status 0 (Junior High) and 1 (High School) produce non-null generation
    end note
